{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他以前怕争取会磨掉那份亲近，便想退回心里的安宁，可他也见过，只退回来，妨碍那种生活的事仍会照旧。\",\n      \"key\": \"只退回来\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"这回他把对那种生活的牵挂带进眼前的事里，发现自己做的事也在替它争取，那种生活反而近了些。\",\n      \"key\": \"带进眼前的事\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他做着眼前的事，心里仍惦记那种生活，这份牵挂反而给他劲头，久违的快乐也回来了。\",\n      \"key\": \"给他劲头\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他知道再使劲也不保证能过上那种生活，若只顾硬撑，还可能把想护住的温柔磨掉。\",\n      \"key\": \"磨掉温柔\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他肯让自己歇一歇，可那种生活还没回来，他仍不知道眼前的事能不能护住它。\",\n      \"key\": \"歇一歇\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"text\": \"真要付出代价时，他还是可能累得想退回那份安宁。\",\n      \"key\": \"退回安宁\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"text\": \"他把劲放下来，不再反复证明自己该往前，仍想护住那种生活，也珍惜那份安宁给过他的快乐。\",\n      \"key\": \"把劲放下来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"动摇\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-6\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-7\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-7\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R66\", \"R67\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\", \"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留旧愿从退路变成行动理由的关键转折。把R67与R68重复的行动主张合并，改成他亲自经历过的事实：只退回心里的安宁，妨碍那种生活的事仍会照旧。再写出他带着牵挂行动，反而觉得离愿望近了些。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R76\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\", \"S13-4\", \"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动与旧愿开始相连、但不能保证结果的判断，以及行动不能耗尽所爱这一限制。把抽象的坚持原则和价值总结改成具体担心：再使劲也未必过上那种生活，硬撑还可能磨掉自己想护住的温柔。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R70\", \"R71\", \"R72\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把两种心意共同推动他、承担责任时仍惦记旧愿、经历疲惫后快乐重新回来，合成一条同时发生的心理经验。去掉宣布两边已经整合完成的抽象总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R73\", \"R74\", \"R77\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\", \"S13-6\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"分别保留眼下那种生活仍未实现、行动能否护住它仍无把握，以及将来真正付出代价时仍可能疲惫退缩。删去R77与结果未知重复的部分，不把结尾写成已经解决冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R75\", \"R78\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\", \"S13-7\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写并收束\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动与旧愿都真实、谁也不能替代谁，也保留他不再需要反复证明自己该往前。改成他仍带着牵挂做事，也珍惜那份安宁曾给过的快乐。结尾补上原来缺失的B4：绷紧的劲放下来后，想护住的生活和曾经得到的快乐仍清楚地留在心里。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0812fec4-b304-4351-91f9-e00c8085e339", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232639587092Z", "elapsed_seconds": 209.718, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T23:30:09.325398+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2947017bed9ada3bafea735d2661ece40da544e518cffbe957e6bca9dc35d8b6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T232639587092Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3fd9d329e9cd1a2748d704058dc8f71d226daadc1a7fd3656cb9c6c398778f63"}}}
